{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "comment": "Engine environments of CyTools_MeshStudio. Each engine is one private virtual environment under runtime/engines, shared by every backend whose dependency stack is identical. Grouping was derived from the environments of the absorbed Tools (see app/Docs/Architecture.md); a backend is only declared tested once it has really been executed here.",
  "engines": {
